{#-
  ============================================================================
  Initial upstream list for the acquisition stack's resolver.
  Rendered ONCE, by Ansible, and owned by frey-media-dns-upstream afterwards.
  ============================================================================

  Deployed with force:false on purpose. Ansible guarantees this file exists;
  it must not keep rewriting it. Re-rendering it on every deploy would
  overwrite a live fallback with upstreams the current network blocks, and
  take DNS away from the entire acquisition stack until the timer next ran.

  See the `dns:` note in defaults/main.yml.
-#}
# Managed by frey-media-dns-upstream. Do not edit - it is rewritten.
# mode: seed   written: by Ansible at deploy time
{% for server in media_acquisition.dns.upstreams %}
server={{ server }}
{% endfor %}
